  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IRCT- Int. Rehab. Council Torture Victims</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">IRCT- Int. Rehab. Council Torture Victims</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">IRCT &#xe4;r en internationell medlemsorganisation med s&#xe4;te i K&#xf6;penhamn    som sedan 1985 arbetar med rehabilitering av tortyroffer samt         spridning av information f&#xf6;r att f&#xf6;rebygga och f&#xf6;rhindra tortyr.      IRCT&apos;s medlemmar best&#xe5;r av 146 oberoende organisationer i 73 l&#xe4;nder   som behandlar och rehabiliterar &#xf6;ver 100 000 tortyroffer per &#xe5;r.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main focus of the organisation is to strengthen the capacity of   existing rehabilitation centers and to develop rehabilitation methods for the treatment of torture victims. Another important aspect of     IRCTs work is advocacy and dissemination of knowledge, for            facilitating this work IRCT has small offices in Brussels and Geneva.</narrative>
  </description>
